  <item>
    <title>08 青声说 x 杜世超：爱是勇敢者的奖励</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6784d0783e8fd0e155fa990f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6784d0783e8fd0e155fa990f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 07:38:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span><b><span>倦怠</span></b><span>弥散的空气里，</span></span></p><p><span><span>我们从</span><b><span>太远的远方</span></b><span>和</span><b><span>太深的自我</span></b><span>里抽离，</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>向身边、向关系</span></span></strong><span><span>发问</span></span></p><span><br><p><span><span>关于</span><b><span>爱</span></b><span>的话题</span><span><span>总是没有标准答案，</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>寻找答案的过程却塑造了我们对</span><span><b><span>亲密关系</span></b><span><span>的理解与想象</span></span></span></span></p></span></blockquote><br><p><span>本期青声说，我们邀请了复旦大学社会学系的</span><strong><span>杜世超老师</span></strong></p><p><span>和书店的店员朋友们一同聊聊</span><strong><span>亲密关系</span></strong></p><br><p><span>维系一段关系是复杂的课题，</span><strong><span>告别</span></strong><span>呢？</span></p><p><span>个体的独立性与对关系的依赖性如何权衡？</span></p><p><span>亲密关系中有</span><strong><span>BE</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>HE</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span>爱是一阵</span><strong><span>刺痛</span></strong><span>、一次</span><strong><span>创造</span></strong><span>、一种</span><strong><span>能力</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>......</span></p><br><p><span>如果对这期节目感兴趣，那么就继续往下听吧！</span></p><br><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><p><strong><span>杜世超</span></strong></p><p><b><span>官方介绍：</span></b><span>复旦大学社会学系青年副研究员</span></p><p><b><span>店员印象：</span></b><span>帅气幽默有才华的杜学长</span></p><br><p><span>【本期主持】</span></p><p><strong><span>展展</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>一平</span></strong></p><br><p><span>【本期执行】</span></p><p><span>来自</span><strong><span>琛酱</span></strong><span>的策划</span></p><p><span>来自</span><strong><span>展展、一平、松白、KK</span></strong><span>的录制</span></p><p><span>来自</span><strong><span>琛酱、展展</span></strong><span>的妙手剪辑</span></p><br><p><span>在本期节目中，你可以</span><strong><span>听到：</span></strong></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a></span></b><span> 从社会学的视角认识附近</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a></span></b><span> 你会和《再见爱人 4》里的谁一起去荒岛旅行</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a></span></b><span> 对亲密关系的想象：影视作品中存在你的理想型吗</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a></span></b><span> 亲密关系中的HE与BE</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a></span></b><span> 对“恋爱脑”标签的看法</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a></span></b><span> 婚姻与家庭：父母对亲密关系的影响</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a></span></b><span> 大胆去恋爱吧——</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">52:44</a></span></b><span>&nbsp;告别也是亲密关系的重要功课</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">72:30</a></span></b><span> 它与他与她：如何看待虚拟恋人/亲密关系服务</span></p><br><p><span>【出品】</span></p><p><span>青书馆</span></p>]]></description>
