  </item>
  <item>
    <title>07 播客店员版：专业，大学生的另一种MBTI</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ff0b0be889ab518d0b72d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ff0b0be889ab518d0b72d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 01:59:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span><span>在微信备注里，专业是跟随在名字后的小尾巴，</span><span><span>一</span><span><span>种比MBTI来得隐形的标签</span></span></span></span></p></blockquote><br><p><span><strong><span>【关于本期】</span></strong></span></p><p><span>本期青声说</span></p><p><span>幕后的播客店员成为主场的嘉宾</span></p><p><span>围坐在一起</span><strong><span>聊聊彼此的专业</span></strong></p><br><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>航空航天：</span><strong><span>KK</span></strong></p><p><span>中文系：</span><strong><span>小蓓</span></strong></p><p><span>心理学：</span><strong><span>展展</span></strong></p><p><span>社会学：</span><strong><span>琛酱</span></strong></p><p><span>新闻学：</span><strong><span>丰丰</span></strong></p><p><span>大数据：</span><strong><span>松白</span></strong></p><br><p><strong><span>【本期剪辑】</span></strong></p><p><span>来自播客女工</span><strong><span>小蓓、KK</span></strong><span>的妙手剪辑</span></p><br><p><span>在进入节目以前，先一起看看嘉宾们专业相关的生活碎片吧～</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8b18-audiofreehighqps/56/05/GKwRIJELF2TuAAMTtwM0U9OQ.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><blockquote><p><span>禁瘦令舞台剧</span></p></blockquote><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8fca-audiofreehighqps/CB/13/GKwRIaILF2UCABZBqAM0U9-B.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><blockquote><p><span>没有一个心理咨询学生能逃过Oh卡</span></p></blockquote><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ffb7-audiofreehighqps/7D/9C/GAqhDJELF2UpAALvpAM0U_T2.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><blockquote><p><span>在电视台纪录片部实习的铁血拷卡工</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4e03-audiofreehighqps/97/0E/GAqhAwwLF3AdACpllAM0WizI.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>“铸器于融铝”</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ccbf-audiofreehighqps/7B/A1/GAqhAwwLF2caABB2MgM0VTG9.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>在王安石诞辰日进行的古文考试</span></p></blockquote><p><span>......</span></p><br><p><strong><span>【TA们说】</span></strong></p><p><span>“专业带给我的是，</span></p><p><span>一个</span><b><span>不断地去问为什么</span></b><span>的</span></p><p><span>思考方式。”</span></p><br><p><span>“文学总是在乎字词句段。</span></p><p><span>如同</span><b><span>逗点的意义</span></b><span>，告诉你要为</span></p><p><span>那个死去的士兵有所停顿。”</span></p><br><p><span>“集体外被剔除掉的异常值，</span></p><p><span>有时才是</span><b><span>被忽视的少数身上</span></b></p><p><b><span>最重要的地方</span></b><span>。”</span></p><br><p><span>“社会学不会帮你解决问题，</span></p><p><span>却能</span><b><span>帮你过得更加豁达</span></b><span>，</span></p><p><span>因为你就没有什么不能理解的问题。”</span></p><br><p><span>“面对面永远是最好的沟通方式，</span></p><p><span>要去认识</span><b><span>更具体的人</span></b><span>。”</span></p><br><p><span>“从一种</span><b><span>宏观的视角</span></b><span>分析规律，</span></p><p><span>这是专业带给我们的工具。”</span></p><br><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> &nbsp;何以在荒岛、末日中各显神通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> &nbsp;一个比喻：洗脚水、文献学、炼丹术师、读心专家、新传民工</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a> &nbsp;专业与MBTI的双重联动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> &nbsp;平反TIME：这个那个的刻板印象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">1:05:17</a>&nbsp;你获得理想，我得到面包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4742">1:19:02</a>&nbsp;步入社会以后，专业在我们身上还留下什么？</span></p><br><p><strong><span>【出品】</span></strong></p><p><span>青书馆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRINsLFL09ACAAAAMzLJBB.mp3.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=75761601&amp;track_id=777056174&amp;uid=467629559&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/6b7a-audiofreehighqps/05/C0/GKwRINsLFL09ACAAAAMzLJBB.mp3" length="135991342" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/645632f220a332a9f562e1d4/Fkkc3jCxD5m1nGP-qYbtduFxGVlh.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>06 毕业倒计时：当我走出学校，当我跃入人海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666abc9c82bbd81a5b68ebb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666abc9c82bbd81a5b68ebb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 09:01:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>无论如何，亲爱的朋友</span></p><p><span>你知道的，你仍然拥有海洋</span></p><br><p><span>本期青声说，我们邀请了</span></p><p><strong><span>今年快要毕业的朋友们</span></strong><span>一起聊聊，</span></p><p><span>毕业的感想，生活的回顾，未来的想法</span></p><br><p><span>/继续攻读博士学位/</span></p><p><span>/走向互联网，成为真正的打工人/</span></p><p><span>/前路未定，但仍然相信前路/</span></p><br><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><p><strong><span>泽北、</span></strong><strong><span>橙子、西米</span></strong></p><br><p><span>【本期主持】</span></p><p><strong><span>R君</span></strong><span>，正在毕业中</span></p><p><strong><span>小蓓</span></strong><span>，正在期末季</span></p><br><p><span>【本期剪辑】</span></p><p><span>来自</span><strong><span>R君、小蓓</span></strong><span>的妙手剪辑</span></p><br><p><span>【出品】</span></p><p><span>青书馆</span></p><br><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 大学生活关键词：和解？探索？梦幻？</span></strong></p><p><span>“你确定你要报这个专业吗？”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 步入校园生活</span></strong></p><p><span>“想象与现实有偏差”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 咔嚓！记录与定格</span></strong></p><p><span>“离别的时刻、瑰丽的色彩、破灭的瞬间”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a> 关于遗憾</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 毕业倒计时，此刻的状态</span></strong></p><p><span>“成为一个不动声色的大人？”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 终点·起点</span></strong></p><p><span>“我想对刚进入大学的自己，我觉得他做的每一件事情都还不错”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a> 未来将来</span></strong></p><p><span>“我不是那个会被大风吹走的羽毛球”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3388">56:28</a> 请，留下一句话吧</span></strong></p><br>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GArMLwMKQHcuACAAAALhETJQ.mp3.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=75761601&amp;track_id=734670988&amp;uid=467629559&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/fe79-audiofreehighqps/BF/E5/GArMLwMKQHcuACAAAALhETJQ.mp3" length="100406120" type="audio/mp4"/>
